# Keep line endings in the repository as LF and check them out as LF,
# regardless of each machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone (where core.autocrlf defaults to true)
# materialises every text file with CRLF, contradicting .editorconfig and
# breaking the mvnw shell script. `text=auto` still detects binary files
# such as favicon.ico and leaves them alone.
#
# apps/api/.gitattributes still wins for that directory: mvnw.cmd needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
